commit e828a755604ca34444ff875a5cdf10130bd80f86

C03: the quoted YouTube title counts with collapsed whitespace and the retry hint names the whole title (MUSIC1557)

MUSIC1555 measured that the reviewed playback resolved, played and verified the first YouTube result with its observed title, but no final survived: the drafts that quoted the whole title wrote it with single spaces where the observed title carries doubled ones («Lofi  Study»), and the others quoted only a fragment («Smooth Criminal»). The two media-transport name checks in llm.py now match any whitespace run against one, the playback instruction asks for the whole title from beginning to end, and the missing_name retry hint for a verified YouTube playback names the observed title verbatim inside quotation marks. Registry-wide recogniser diff: no literal changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


